From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Media: libvpx and ffvpx configuration for 32-bit ARM Windows
 (generated)

The win/arm configuration libvpx and ffvpx lack upstream: the run-time CPU
detection tables and config headers for ARMv7 with NEON on Windows.

Generated -- tools/gen-libvpx-win-arm-rtcd.sh and
tools/gen-ffvpx-win32-arm-config.py make them; on a newer Firefox, run the
tools again rather than applying this patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
